/**
 * Crop parameter library.
 *
 * Agronomic parameters follow FAO Irrigation & Drainage Paper 56 (Allen et al.
 * 1998): basal crop coefficients (Kcb), stage lengths, rooting depth and the
 * soil-water depletion fraction p. Heat thresholds and nitrogen coefficients
 * come from the crop-specific literature cited on each entry.
 *
 * Calendar (planting day, season length) and economics are regional and live in
 * regions.js, because they are the part that genuinely changes by location.
 */

